00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:44.320
...unless we can't because Gatekeeper&nbsp;
blocks it. Because by default,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:51.920
any downloaded file on macOS is quarantined.&nbsp;
Gatekeeper prevents executing quarantined files&nbsp;&nbsp;

